  aciklama:
  - "Fincan\u0131n\u0131n \xFCst k\u0131s\u0131mlar\u0131na bakt\u0131\u011F\u0131mda
    alt\u0131n bir kalem sembol\xFC g\xF6rd\xFCm. Yak\u0131n zamanda baz\u0131 gizli
    duygular\u0131n\u0131 a\xE7\u0131\u011Fa vuraca\u011F\u0131n\u0131 anl\u0131yorum.
    Hep a\xE7\u0131klamak istedi\u011Fin fakat \xE7ekindi\u011Fin \u015Feyleri bu
    kez bir \xE7\u0131rp\u0131da ortaya d\xF6k\xFCverece\u011Fini hissediyorum {{isim}}.
    Bu kalemin alt\u0131ndan olmas\u0131 ise \xE7ekincelerinin asl\u0131nda yersiz
    oldu\u011Funa, s\xF6ylemlerinden dolay\u0131 pas tutmayaca\u011F\u0131na, zarar
    g\xF6rmeyece\u011Fine i\u015Faret. Telvelerin, hislerini a\xE7\u0131klad\u0131\u011F\u0131nda
    tahminlerinin aksine olumlu tepkilerle kar\u015F\u0131la\u015Faca\u011F\u0131n\u0131n
    kan\u0131t\u0131. S\xF6yleyeceklerinin i\xE7tenli\u011Fi kar\u015F\u0131ndaki
    insan ya da insanlar\u0131 derinden etkileyecek."
